Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.34,0:00:07.41,Default,Chief,0,0,0,,他们一定发布了我的寻人启事了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:14.13,Default,Chief,0,0,0,,说到底都怪公司没脑子催我这种开发主机游戏的去做什么网游
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.13,0:00:15.91,Default,Chief,0,0,0,,才搞出那么大亏损
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:17.33,Default,Chief,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:40.27,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,这便是我为了这个游戏\N特地用奴隶生物修格斯改造出来的杀戮机器
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:41.99,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,那么人类们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:45.15,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,如果你们不想被切得四分五裂的话 就跑吧 跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:48.45,Default,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,提克利-利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:50.57,Default,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,提克利-利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.57,0:00:53.26,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,那家伙不分敌我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.26,0:00:54.66,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,都一起干掉的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:58.45,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,请看 现在只剩三十分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:01.21,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,能在这所开心邪神学园里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.21,0:01:03.96,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,存活下来的究竟会是哪一位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.09,0:02:39.89,Default,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:41.11,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,前面也有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:41.82,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:43.34,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,我们要比它们更快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:47.40,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,必须要这样连着跑完剩下三十分钟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.65,0:02:52.03,Default,Tsugumi,0,0,0,,它们离开了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:53.65,Default,Tsugumi,0,0,0,,虽然对不起那些孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:02:57.01,Default,Takagi,0,0,0,,如果那些怪物和它们的长相一样蠢的话就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:03:00.28,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,那些家伙说过不会搞无法过关的游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:03.04,Default,Takagi,0,0,0,,是啊 搞出无法通关的游戏属于违反契约了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:05.99,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,契约条款是绝对的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.99,0:03:08.37,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,这方面对我们也是痛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:11.21,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,我们是真的拿这点没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:16.34,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,阿撒托斯先生也是连结着日本的游戏机的状态拿它没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.62,0:03:20.55,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,格亚君 使用野蛮的暴力的时代已经过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:23.66,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,我们邪神也需要版本更新一下才行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:25.78,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,该说是旧日支配者2.0吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.78,0:03:29.15,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,真棒啊 肯定也能在小朋友圈子里爆红吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:30.86,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,必须要出周边了吧这
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:32.85,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,但是咱这也没小孩子在看的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:38.11,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,啊 我们的杀戮机器好像盯上了欠债女演员
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:39.16,DefaultTop,Tsugumi,0,0,0,,换个外号啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:42.12,Default,Tsugumi,0,0,0,,该死 这东西到底有多少只啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:45.29,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,我们准备了和玩家数量一样的七只
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:48.58,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,怎么样 我精心培养的自豪的修格斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:49.75,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,可爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:50.63,Default,Zhar,0,0,0,,恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:51.46,Default,Lloigor,0,0,0,,猎奇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:53.25,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.25,0:03:55.96,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,鸫选手能不能逃脱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:03:59.43,Default,Tsugumi,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:01.34,Default,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,提克利-利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:02.26,Default,Takagi,0,0,0,,快趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:07.24,Default,Takagi,0,0,0,,看来成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:08.60,Default,Takagi,0,0,0,,就是现在 快跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:19.86,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这间房是空着的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:22.66,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:25.91,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,还剩二十五分钟 能在这里躲到时间结束吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:30.74,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那些杂鱼在到处找我们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:33.08,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,就算是那种东西也还是会分工的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:38.27,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,那这里也很快就会被找到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:39.80,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,真到那个时候了 就对不住了 神奈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:42.55,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,为什么要以牺牲我为前提啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:45.29,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,你们真的有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:47.38,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,下次让你们来做我漫画角色的模特儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:48.39,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,很有意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:50.38,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你还真能在这种状况下说出这种话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.38,0:04:51.29,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,笑死了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:52.37,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:54.82,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,虽然一开始就这么觉得了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:57.35,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你好像一点都不害怕吧 不如说…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.35,0:05:01.48,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,这种异常状况在别的地方可体验不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:06.33,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,在这种被逼上绝路的时候才会诞生真正的灵感啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:07.33,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:10.25,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,命和灵感到底哪边更重要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.25,0:05:11.92,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,那当然是灵感啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:15.21,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,我可是从初中就开始画漫画了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:17.21,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,这不是当然的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:22.19,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,真是个脑子有问题的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.19,0:05:24.51,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,看得我都有点亲近感了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:25.93,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,看看他的理智值是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:27.57,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,诶哟 四十四
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:30.73,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,这人从一开始就有点脑子坏得恰到好处
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:32.84,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,这还真是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:37.40,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,休息结束了 我们上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:42.49,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,我 我们要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.37,0:05:49.60,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你要干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:51.78,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,还想着是不是能这么打倒它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:53.91,Default,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,提克利-利
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:57.37,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,灵子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:05:58.63,DefaultTop,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,利
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:05:58.63,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:01.84,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,灵子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:04.01,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,就这么走了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:06.56,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,看来是有锁定机制吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:07.58,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你这人真是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:08.54,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,别在意别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.54,0:06:10.44,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,毕竟是生存游戏嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:12.21,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,不 这不是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:15.19,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,你搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:21.53,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,甩掉了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.01,Default,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,提克利
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:30.37,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,灵子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.03,0:06:45.07,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:47.05,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,老师你为什么来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.05,0:06:49.26,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,难道你是那种笨蛋老好人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.03,0:06:51.64,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,我是想过来救你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:53.83,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,哈 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.83,0:06:57.10,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,最好是我的错觉 但你不会是萝——
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.92,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,请不要误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.39,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,我是教育从业者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:03.31,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,可不能眼睁睁看着小孩子们牺牲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.54,0:07:08.66,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,还真有那种电视剧里的老师啊 诶…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:10.16,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:11.74,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,也不是不行 就是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.97,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这种人不是会很吃亏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:15.37,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,我天生就是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:17.30,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,{\an3}倒也没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:19.34,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,{\an3}姑且先谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.97,0:07:20.83,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,{\an3}还有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:22.77,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你能放开我的手了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.77,0:07:24.30,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,啊 这真是对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.67,0:07:25.67,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,果然你是萝——
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.43,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,请不要误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:30.68,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,对我来说男性和女性是一样美好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:32.93,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你这么说我反而觉得更可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:35.49,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,没问题 我分得很清的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.49,0:07:37.27,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,和家人们也相处得毫无问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.27,0:07:39.20,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你还有家人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:42.02,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,以后请和我保持至少一米的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:44.35,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,没问题 我分得很清的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:49.74,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:52.91,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,看来被选上的参赛选手都有点那个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:54.91,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,说成「有点那个」还真是恰到好处
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.91,0:07:59.25,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,说到底只有能留下印象的人才会被阿撒托斯选上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:03.09,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,脑子越有病的人才越能炒热气氛 这就是他的方针
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.09,0:08:05.00,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,我也渐渐弄清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:06.41,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,自己有多异常吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.41,0:08:08.89,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,是说那些怪物们的行动模式
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:13.65,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,时间进入后半战 还剩下十五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.65,0:08:18.02,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,可怜的羊羔们能从杀戮机器的恐怖中逃脱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.17,0:08:20.77,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,这家伙什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:24.15,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,是因为我很可爱才会追着我的 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:30.01,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,不要因为我可爱就追过来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.01,0:08:32.28,Default,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,提克利-利——
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:36.74,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,在游戏过程中呼叫运营我觉得不是很合适啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:41.90,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,这游戏的胜利奖金是一人一百万 一共有七百万对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:43.06,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:46.34,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,那些失败的玩家的奖金会怎么处理呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:49.26,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,会累计到下一次的奖池之类的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:50.30,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,并不会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:52.93,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,{\an3}那么如果搞PK的话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:55.68,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,是猎杀玩家的意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:59.77,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,瑛太选手 你还真是视财如命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.77,0:09:02.02,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,不 我并不需要钱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:06.74,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:10.07,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,比起奖金来 你有更想要实现的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:14.65,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,奖金可以兑换成点数 用以改变现实
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:16.30,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,改变现实的示例如下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:18.91,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,一百万点 无法预测的幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:21.99,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,一千万点 对他人生死的掌控
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.99,0:09:25.04,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,一亿点 对集体进行干涉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:27.92,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,十亿点 对神进行干涉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.80,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,不错 不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:32.30,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,那就请你多加油了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:43.49,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,NAO老师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:45.10,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,是瑛太君啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:48.11,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,你在画什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:50.07,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,我们探索过的地方的地图
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:52.34,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,你全都能记住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:53.64,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,毕竟我是漫画家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.64,0:09:54.86,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,不愧是漫画家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:57.20,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,就像是《僵尸部落》的主人公一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:00.20,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,哪怕不擅长打架 也能靠头脑来取胜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:03.96,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,啊哈哈 因为他是我遵从自己内心创作出的主角
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:05.29,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,「果然还得靠头脑吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:07.21,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,出现了！ 口头禅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:11.05,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,都到这种状况了 老师是不是有点太乐在其中了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.05,0:10:13.71,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,这也是取材 我在找点子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:16.80,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,那新连载也很快就会开始了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:20.77,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,那个嘛 就得看编辑那边了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:22.35,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:24.40,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,这可一定得活下来才行了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:25.60,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:27.72,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,NAO老师 我已经搞明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:30.19,DefaultTop,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,提克利-利！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:31.99,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,那台机器有固定的行动模式
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:36.68,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,存在岔路时 一定会走右边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:42.04,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,只是 如果找到目标的话 就会锁定目标并紧追不舍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:47.56,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,但是似乎只要头部收到一定的伤害就会重置
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:52.38,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,然后重启后 会右转90°继续运行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:55.59,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,就是说可以诱导机器对吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:56.72,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,答对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:58.85,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,能赢 能赢啊！ 瑛太君
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:10:59.80,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,赢下来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:05.45,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,从我画的地图中选出能让它一直绕圈的地方把它引过去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:08.69,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,就能让它一直向右转向 进入死循环
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:19.07,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,瑛太君
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:20.78,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,它进入循环了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:23.62,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,什么！ 行动模式被发现了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:24.66,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,诶—不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:26.54,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,杀人机器 干活啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:28.92,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,制造循环 这是利用游戏漏洞了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:31.67,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,看来祂测试得不太充分啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:35.83,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,修格斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:38.21,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,停下！ 别右转了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:42.00,DefaultTop,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,余宠爱的修格斯！ 听话啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:43.67,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,哎呀 这会是瑛太选手和NAO-KICHI选手头脑战的胜利吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:45.47,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,笑死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:48.98,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,NAO老师 还有其它能让它们绕圈的地方吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.98,0:11:52.52,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,对了 图书馆的话可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.32,0:12:02.68,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,瑛太君 看这张地图
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:05.95,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,这里是用书架组成的迷宫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:08.10,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,所以只要封死这两个地方的路
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:11.96,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,即使它们进入了图书馆 也会自己绕一圈出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:13.04,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,怎么封住？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:15.13,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,用这些书就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.41,0:12:18.13,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,把书堆起来建成墙堵住道路就行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:20.72,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,那就把地图借给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:23.06,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,另一堵墙就由我来堆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:23.97,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:24.97,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,帮大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:26.85,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,那么 我出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:27.97,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:29.69,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,NAO老师也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:40.38,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,已就位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:41.61,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:49.76,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,瑛太君 你那边好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:51.51,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:58.13,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,难道 瑛太君他…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:13:01.16,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,瑛太君 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:03.20,Default,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,提克利-利
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:04.27,Default,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,提克利
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.27,0:13:06.56,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,你没事吧？  回答我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.48,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我在这里 NAO老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:14.94,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,为什么你会在那里…？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.24,0:13:22.01,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,越是觉得自己聪明的家伙才越是好骗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.01,0:13:23.41,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,你说…什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:28.07,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,这里已经不存在什么安全区域了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:30.16,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.63,0:13:37.67,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,混蛋！你没有堵住道路就把这些家伙引过来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:39.55,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,恭喜你答对了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.55,0:13:42.51,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,为什么？ 我们不是要一起赢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.51,0:13:44.01,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,谁管你这个那个的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:47.24,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,从一开始我就不需要什么同伴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:51.85,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,这里是运营 在此宣布追加PK规则
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:57.73,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,「果然还得靠头脑」对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:14:01.00,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,混蛋！ 你明明说是我的粉丝的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:06.70,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,那个啊 《僵尸部落》的最终回我可是讨厌死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:08.20,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,你不是说喜欢的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:10.95,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,连载中的时候 我是超级喜欢的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:14.16,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,但那个主角最后干的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:16.37,Default,Hero,0,0,0,,我有同伴在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.37,0:14:18.00,Default,Zombie,0,0,0,,你说同伴！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.26,Default,Hero,0,0,0,,就算是这样的我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:22.16,Default,Hero,0,0,0,,也有相信我跟着我的同伴在！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:26.28,Default,Hero,0,0,0,,这是只盲信自己的人最后的下场
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:27.87,Default,Hero,0,0,0,,结束了 结束了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:30.39,Default,Hero,0,0,0,,果然还得是同伴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:34.65,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,{\an1}同伴？我看是同伙才对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:37.27,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,{\an1}那他做的事和第一话的霸凌者有什么区别？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:40.32,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,{\an1}明明是作者自己画出来的 你都忘光了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:42.82,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,那是因为追加的角色越来越多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:45.06,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,我觉得改成这样读者才更能接受…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.06,0:14:46.30,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,找什么借口！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:50.27,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我最后终于懂了 这漫画压根什么信念都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.27,0:14:52.96,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,所以都无所谓了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:57.83,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,所以说！ 画出那种东西的我自己才是最明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:15:00.29,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,什么啊 你原来知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:04.98,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,所以我发誓 下次连载绝不对自己撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:07.01,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,我要画不让自己后悔的漫画！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:09.47,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,然后 十周就腰斩了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:15.23,Default,Characters,0,0,0,,我们的战斗才刚刚开始啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:17.38,Default,Characters,0,0,0,,说得好啊 伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:19.57,Default,Characters,0,0,0,,就让我奉陪到地狱的最底层吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.57,0:15:22.02,Default,Characters,0,0,0,,要把命运什么全都揍飞！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:23.90,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,{\an3}所以…所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:27.05,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,{\an3}下一次连载一定要…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:29.28,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,{\an3}已经没有\N「下一次连载」了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:33.66,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,找灵感 虽然满嘴说的都是找灵感
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.66,0:15:35.41,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,但我知道你只是在嘴硬哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:37.04,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,对你的印象都幻灭了 老师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.46,0:15:42.27,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,在这个游戏里也一样 被切成碎块完蛋去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:52.01,Default,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,提克利——！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.81,0:16:03.37,Default,All,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:10.24,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,- 漫画家！ - 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.46,0:16:12.83,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,瑛太 你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:14.15,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:16.18,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,啊 真麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:19.65,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我们可是在玩游戏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.65,0:16:20.92,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,当然得赢才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.92,0:16:23.75,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那又为什么非要对其他玩家出手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:29.01,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,如果击杀玩家的话 就能获得该玩家应得的奖金
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:32.00,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,是由我提议才新增这条规则的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:33.22,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,好好感谢我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.54,0:16:39.28,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,还有五分钟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:42.19,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,还足够再杀一个人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.55,0:16:47.78,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,感觉你和我很像 所以暂时还不想杀掉你就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:48.82,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:52.37,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,各位 放学的时间要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.37,0:16:57.60,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,在校内逗留的学生请注意安全
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.17,0:17:04.34,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那是什么声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:07.38,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,不好不好不好不好——
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:11.22,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,这啥这啥这啥这啥啊——
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:13.00,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:15.26,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,最后五分钟的高潮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:16.97,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,Machine rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.97,0:17:20.68,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,试着从追加的13台狂暴化杀戮机器的追捕中活下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:21.69,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,根本没说过啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.69,0:17:22.59,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,现在说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.59,0:17:23.40,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,惯例如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.65,0:17:25.02,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,该死的运营！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:26.26,DefaultTop,Takagi,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:27.02,Default,Tsugumi,0,0,0,,骗人骗人骗人骗人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:31.49,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,从上次开始祂们就喜欢这种多余的戏剧效果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:34.20,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,所以我早就猜到会这样了 但这也…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:37.65,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,尽搞些乱七八糟的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.65,0:17:41.03,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,为什么祂们的脑子会被日本综艺荼毒至此啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:43.25,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,这种戏剧效果根本不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.25,0:17:44.88,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,还有三分钟！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:47.24,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,能活到最后的到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:52.93,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,好机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.55,0:17:56.30,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,灵子！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.94,0:17:59.22,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,你就加油吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.06,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:00.93,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,灵子！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:05.39,Default,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,提克利-利——
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:23.12,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,什么？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:27.02,Default,Shoggoth,0,0,0,,提克利
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.02,0:18:28.39,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,圭姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.39,0:18:30.47,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,你俩都没事真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.47,0:18:31.96,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,总算及时赶到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.01,0:18:34.42,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,修格斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.42,0:18:38.10,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,别光内斗 去打玩家啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:40.39,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,喂！ 往那边看！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:43.07,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,它们被狂暴化反而帮了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:44.85,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,圭姐 你怎么在这
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.48,0:19:01.16,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,结束了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:03.47,Default,Tsugumi,0,0,0,,我们活下来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:05.12,Default,Takagi,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.11,0:19:07.61,Default,Takagi,0,0,0,,那是出口吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.10,0:19:11.41,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,余的修格斯…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:16.72,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,通关！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.01,0:19:19.40,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,恭喜各位
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:21.76,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,…虽然我想这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:26.27,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,那么 这是怎么回事呢？天丛圭小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:29.10,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,我也要作为玩家参加这个游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.61,0:19:30.97,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,请把我注册成玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:34.19,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,哦呀？这我可就难办了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.19,0:19:36.03,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,说到底你应该是运营一方的…
Comment: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:41.49,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,嘀嗒人 你明明身为(守密人,keeper) 却和瑛太君私下订约
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:41.49,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,嘀嗒人 你明明身为守密人 却和瑛太君私下订约
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:41.49,Ruby,Kei,0,0,0,,{\fs46\pos(893,992)}keeper
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.27,0:19:44.50,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,这是重大的违约行为
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:46.96,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,但只要你将我认可为玩家的话 我将不再追究
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:49.46,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,是交换条件吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.71,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.59,0:19:56.80,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,我就允许你作为玩家进行注册吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:20:00.12,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,圭姐 你明明没必要亲身参加的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:01.53,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:06.02,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,是我没能阻止开发部长 因此我也应该负起责任
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:09.73,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,吼吼 良心的谴责 来这套啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.73,0:20:11.22,Default,Zhar,0,0,0,,在假装正义呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:12.06,Default,Lloigor,0,0,0,,装好人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:14.57,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,不也挺好吗！ 反正气氛燃起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:19.82,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,虽然表现得很强硬 但随时在发疯的边缘嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:22.66,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,她还能承受多久呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.99,0:20:28.21,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,那么各位 今天就到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.21,0:20:30.33,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,下次游戏见！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:37.59,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,真的好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:39.55,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,我已经下定决心了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.55,0:20:43.93,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,明明了解详情 却站在安全地带冷眼旁观
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:47.14,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,我觉得这种行为实在太卑劣了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:48.80,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:54.18,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,下一部连载开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:55.78,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,开始了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:58.69,Default,Naokichi,0,0,0,,彩页！ 从单作封面开始啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:16.67,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,归零了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:19.93,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,游戏内的死亡意味着精神的死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:21.01,Default,Takagi,0,0,0,,陷入疯狂…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.89,0:21:23.51,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,喂 混账家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:24.96,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你现在感觉怎么样啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:26.39,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.39,0:21:28.18,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,那下次游戏见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.11,0:21:35.89,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,那么 瑛太选手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.89,0:21:41.24,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,你并不想接受银行转账 而是打算直接作为积分使用对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:43.08,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,嗯 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:45.74,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,接下来就请交给我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:47.29,Default,Ticktock Man,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:56.63,Default,Newsreader,0,0,0,,昨日在青梅街道 卡车与汽车发生了碰撞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.96,0:21:59.57,Default,Newsreader,0,0,0,,幸运的是 两位司机都只受了轻伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.57,0:22:04.55,Default,Newsreader,0,0,0,,但是 回家途中的高中生被卷入事故 现在意识不明
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.32,0:22:07.31,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,意识不明吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:10.65,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,三百万分就只能做到这步吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.65,0:22:14.19,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,不过 邪神的力量可真方便
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.19,0:22:16.64,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,毕竟这世界就是坨屎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.64,0:22:19.12,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,就让一切按照我说的算吧
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,
